  "body": "Closes #7823\n\n## What\n\nuploadImageFile() in pkgs/id/web/src/image-upload.ts shape-trusted the /api/upload 200 response with a bare cast (as UploadResponse). A wrong-shape 200 resolved malformed values: the caller inserted an image node with src undefined (or a wrong-typed src), or dereferenced null and misreported the failure as Insertion failed.\n\nThis adds parseUploadResponse() at the fetch boundary: the payload must be a non-null, non-array object whose hash, name, and url are all strings (the server contract in pkgs/id/src/web/routes.rs). Anything else throws a clear Upload failed: malformed /api/upload response error, so the existing upload-failure path handles it (warn + placeholder removal, no insertion). Well-formed payloads behave exactly as before.\n\n## Tests (oracle: the payload-shape contract)\n\n- New regression tests in image-upload.test.ts: 9 malformed cases (null, string, array, empty object, missing hash/name/url, non-string hash/url) — all 9 fail pre-fix (49 pass), all pass post-fix.\n- Targeted: bunx vitest run src/image-upload.test.ts — 58/58 pass.\n- Typecheck: bun run typecheck — pass.\n- Full web suite: 678 passed, 9 skipped, 1 failed — the failure (search-panel.test.ts aria-label Replace all) is pre-existing on clean main (verified by stashing this change: same 1 failure), unrelated to this PR.\n\nQueue task 14000, lane code-m.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796768168&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7827&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7827&signature=6e1973cb1161bca710eac0cee387d67dffd3f729238b57ded1d1fb12237887f3\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7827?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
